  "executiveChampionReason": "Sabine is an executive having leadership responsibilities for technical professionals who support the sales of IBM products and services.  In here unique position overseeing technical sales and solutioning, she has a first hand view of client challenges and crafting unique solutions to address these challenges.  These solutions are likely candidates that can be further developed into inventions.  Sharing and developing this skill to an undeserved market will provide great benefits to the individuals, the region and the IBM company. ",
